---
import EyebrowTag from '../ui/EyebrowTag.astro';
---

<section id="manifesto" class="relative py-28 sm:py-36 px-4 sm:px-6 border-y border-white/[0.06] bg-surface-subtle/30 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-8">
      <EyebrowTag text="01 // The Engineering Manifesto" variant="accent" />
    </div>

    <blockquote class="manifesto-text font-display font-semibold text-2xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl text-content-primary leading-[1.25] tracking-tight mb-10 transition-all duration-700">
      "Most developer interfaces either sacrifice architectural rigor for aesthetic novelty, or drown in brutalist utility without human resonance. True engineering excellence lives where fault-tolerant distributed backends meet cinematic, 60fps micro-interactions."
    </blockquote>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 pt-8 border-t border-white/[0.08]">
      <div>
        <span class="block font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-accent-electric mb-2">01. Zero Jitter Policy</span>
        <p class="text-sm text-content-secondary leading-relaxed font-light">
          Every transition is GPU-bound on transforms and opacity. No layout thrashing, no arbitrary CSS reflows, and zero jarring frame drops.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="block font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-accent-telemetry mb-2">02. Deterministic AI</span>
        <p class="text-sm text-content-secondary leading-relaxed font-light">
          Autonomous agents must operate within verified state graphs, vector-grounded memory, and rigid validation boundaries—not blind prompt luck.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="block font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-accent-amber mb-2">03. Resilient Architecture</span>
        <p class="text-sm text-content-secondary leading-relaxed font-light">
          Designed for real-world production: graceful degradation, defensive typing, cryptographic token rotation, and sub-100ms API response budgets.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
